This bundle prepares one RVC v2, 40 kHz, F0-guided multi-speaker base model from:

AISHELL/AISHELL-3 on Hugging Face;
badayvedat/VCTK on Hugging Face;
the official JVS Google Drive archive;
hfm_whisper_110spk.zip in Rvcmodel/gbs.

